    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>71528</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031401</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>いた！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There she is!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>71656</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031402</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あの子……なんで逃げないのさ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Why doesn’t she just run away...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>71784</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031403</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>無理言うな。&lt;Kohaku&gt;は
高所恐怖症で、今はその
『恐怖』を抑える感情もないんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She can’t. Kohaku’s afraid of heights, and fear is the only feeling she knows right now.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>72180</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031404</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うぅ、高いの……やぁ……
助けて……お兄ちゃん……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>*sob* It’s so high... no... Hisui... save me...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>72348</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031405</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あ〜あ、メソメソメソメソ……
うざいっての！　あたし
そーゆーの大っ嫌いなんだよ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ugh, there you go again, “boohoo”... give it a rest, already! I really can’t stand it!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>73704</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031406</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あいつ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Dammit!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>74112</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031407</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ちょ……待てって！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wait...hold it!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>74804</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031408</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うう……
痛い……よぉ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>*sob* ...I’m... scared...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>75048</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031409</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あんたねぇ……
誘拐したあたしが
言うのもなんだけどさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Y’know... I’m the one who kidnapped you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>75048</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031410</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>泣いたって状況は変わらないん
だよ。女だからこそ涙をこらえて
強く生きなきゃダメなんだ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Crying isn’t gonna change anything. Big girls shouldn’t cry, anyway.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>75048</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031411</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ほら、涙をふいてしゃんとしな！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Here, at least wipe your tears!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>77256</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031412</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kohaku&gt;、早く逃げて!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Kohaku, you’ve gotta run!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>77632</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031413</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あ……ああ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah... ahhh...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>77760</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031414</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>だから、逃げられないって
言ってんだろ、ドアホ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I told you she can’t, you meathead!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>77888</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031415</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ちょっとぉ……脅迫されてる
自覚あんの？　不意打ちの挙句
人数まで増えてるしぃ〜!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Now hold up... don’t you realize I’ve got her hostage?! And who brings this many people to an ambush?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>79288</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031416</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うあッ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whoa!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>81084</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031419</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>は〜い、そこまで！
おとなしくスピルーンを渡さないと
お人形さんに傷がつくよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That’s far enough! Just hand over the Spirune and no one has to get hurt.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>81668</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031420</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>くっ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Tch...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>82944</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031421</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そうそう、素直な子は好きだよ∀
そこの変な帽子！
それをこっちに持って来な</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, there’s a good boy! ∀ Hey you, in the dumb hat! Hand it over!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>84720</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031422</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ねぇ、そのスピルーンって
あの子のなんだよね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, that Spirune belongs to that girl, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>84848</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031423</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……なら、ここは
そのパワーを使うしかないよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Well then, good thing a have a trick up my sleeve!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>85484</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031424</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>わぁ、つまづいた！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh no, I’ve fallen!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>87576</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031425</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あっ…………!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah..!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>87704</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031426</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ちょっとぉ！
今、何したッ!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wait! The hell are you doing?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>87888</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031427</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Kohaku&gt;、安心して。
その人は、ひどい事しないから</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Kohaku, you don’t have to be scared. She’s not gonna hurt you!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>88016</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031428</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>…………うそ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Liar.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>88144</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031429</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>本当だよ！
その人の側で
おとなしくしてれば、安全なんだ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It’s true! As long as you don’t move, you’ll be safe!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>88272</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031430</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うそ……
うそッ！
うそッッ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Liar... liar! LIAR!!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>88272</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031431</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うそだぁぁぁーーーーーッッ！！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>YOU LIAR!!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>89528</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031432</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>な……ッ??
こいつもソーマを!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What the?! She’s got a Soma?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>90484</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031433</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>形勢逆転だな。
逃げんなら、追わないぜ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>How the tables have turned. If you stay put, we won’t come after ya.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>90692</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031434</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あーあ、しょーがないかぁ。
超めんどいけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah yeah, whatever. What a pain in the butt...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>90692</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>S031435</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あんたらをボコって
あの子ごと教会に
連れ帰る事にするよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Once I’m done beating the snot outta you lot, I can take her back to the Church.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>91348</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>崩落があったって
聞いたけど、相変わらず
グリム山は美しいなぁ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText/>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>To Do</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>91348</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だが、問題は
この素晴らしい景色を
どう描くかだ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText/>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>To Do</Status>
    </Entry>
